  "description": "Gayana is a faux-Japanese display font featuring traditional Japanese characters.\nBy incorporating traditional Japanese culture and style into your writing, your project will be unique, easy to comprehend, and remembered by everyone. Your projects will look unique and exquisite. \nLogotypes, food banners, branding, brochure, posters, movie titles, book titles, quotes – they may all benefit from this font.\nOf course, using this font in your various design projects will make them excellent and outstanding; many viewers are drawn to the striking and unusual graphic display.\nStart utilizing this typeface in your projects to make them stand out.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Gayana is a faux-Japanese display font featuring traditional Japanese characters.</p>\n<p>By incorporating traditional Japanese culture and style into your writing, your project will be unique, easy to comprehend, and remembered by everyone. Your projects will look unique and exquisite. </p>\n<p>Logotypes, food banners, branding, brochure, posters, movie titles, book titles, quotes – they may all benefit from this font.</p>\n<p>Of course, using this font in your various design projects will make them excellent and outstanding; many viewers are drawn to the striking and unusual graphic display.</p>\n<p>Start utilizing this typeface in your projects to make them stand out.</p>",
